This license covers the code in this repository (index.html, the data/*/*.py
scripts, and the GitHub Actions workflows) only. It does NOT cover the data
those scripts produce -- each dataset carries its own source's terms, which
differ by layer (City of Thunder Bay open data license, OpenStreetMap's ODbL,
CityProtect's non-commercial-use terms, etc.). See the README's "License /
attribution" section and data/README.md for the specific terms that apply to
each dataset.
